@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title CP — bounded current-process evidence need
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Eight source-defined process areas\nPreparation / presentation / actual applications / coordination\nWork / Git-execution / files-admin / operating-recovery" as Areas
rectangle "For a relevant actual case, establish\nActor + trigger + actual inputs/steps/tools/handoffs/output\nAuthority/provenance + exceptions + observed time if needed" as Case
rectangle "Keep unresolved elements explicit\nNo target use case or reference-project name substitutes for observation" as Limit #4A302B
Areas --> Case : only if a dependent conclusion needs this evidence
Case --> Limit : record source / date / method / limits
note bottom of Limit
This is an evidence plan, not a performed session or invented as-is diagram.
No broad study is added as a blanket new gate for independent analysis/design.
end note

legend bottom
Source-based analysis; target behavior and hypotheses are not observed current task sequences.
No interview, business-task timing, live product/reference inspection or improvement test performed.
endlegend
@enduml
